WEBVTT

00:07.790 --> 00:09.070
That's...

00:09.070 --> 00:10.280
Could it be...

00:11.700 --> 00:13.080
Are they human?

00:14.870 --> 00:15.870
Fire arrows!

00:15.870 --> 00:16.500
Watch out!

00:16.500 --> 00:17.830
The barricade is on fire!

00:40.100 --> 00:43.020
SENTENCED TO BE A HERO

01:59.690 --> 02:01.770
Tch. What in the world is going on?

02:02.340 --> 02:05.580
Could they be faerie-corrupted humans,
like the ones we saw in the mine?

02:05.580 --> 02:08.229
No, those guys are different...

02:09.190 --> 02:12.200
They're people allied
with the Demon Blight.

02:12.640 --> 02:13.950
But...

02:13.950 --> 02:18.120
Are there faeries
that can communicate with humans?

02:18.700 --> 02:19.700
Yes...

02:20.970 --> 02:24.010
It's said that such faeries exist.

02:24.570 --> 02:26.180
If that is the case, Xylo...

02:27.210 --> 02:30.040
I cannot attack humans.

02:30.920 --> 02:33.560
Even if they are allied
with the Demon Lord,

02:33.560 --> 02:35.840
I am mechanically unable to do so.

02:37.660 --> 02:38.720
I know.

02:39.310 --> 02:40.850
Kivia, can you hear me?

02:42.710 --> 02:43.310
What is it?

02:43.310 --> 02:46.460
The sacred communication seal is less
effective when used with non-heroes.

02:46.460 --> 02:47.770
Slow down and explain clearly.

02:48.140 --> 02:49.440
What's going on?

02:49.440 --> 02:51.400
Where did those people come from?

02:51.850 --> 02:53.480
I don't know either.

02:53.480 --> 02:54.150
However...

02:54.740 --> 02:57.130
it's definitely a noble's private army.

02:57.130 --> 02:59.240
They're skilled cavalry
and mounted archers.

03:00.950 --> 03:02.690
They've already retreated.

03:02.690 --> 03:04.750
We can't catch up to them
in our heavy armor.

03:04.750 --> 03:05.670
Damn it...

03:05.670 --> 03:07.490
The direction they're heading...

03:08.380 --> 03:09.990
Is it the underground passage?

03:13.290 --> 03:14.050
Eek!

03:15.480 --> 03:16.880
They're getting closer...

03:16.880 --> 03:18.550
Xylo, we're in trouble!

03:18.550 --> 03:20.260
A strange group of people has arrived!

03:20.260 --> 03:22.720
What if they come to me?

03:22.720 --> 03:25.680
- If I die, I'll curse you forever!
- Tch.

03:25.680 --> 03:27.900
Are you only thinking
about your own survival?

03:27.900 --> 03:30.610
Don't worry, Venetim.

03:30.610 --> 03:33.070
Isn't Tatsuya with you?

03:33.590 --> 03:36.740
By the way, can we ask
His Majesty to retreat?

03:37.290 --> 03:39.490
Now that even the kyrack has appeared,

03:40.030 --> 03:41.980
the main gate can't hold out anymore.

03:41.980 --> 03:42.950
No.

03:43.300 --> 03:45.160
If the King retreats,

03:45.160 --> 03:47.170
the kingdom will lose
its spiritual pillar.

03:52.340 --> 03:54.670
Chancellor, where are the reinforcements?

03:54.670 --> 03:55.530
Sigh...

03:56.020 --> 03:58.680
Reinforcements won't come to our aid.

03:58.680 --> 03:59.930
Besides...

04:00.470 --> 04:01.480
Come to think of it,

04:01.960 --> 04:03.640
you're not the king, are you?

04:04.070 --> 04:05.850
In that case...

04:06.300 --> 04:08.560
Open the gunports!

04:08.920 --> 04:10.860
Opening gunports!

04:13.900 --> 04:15.030
That's...

04:15.030 --> 04:16.529
Runtels.

04:16.860 --> 04:19.070
They're sacred seal-engraved cannons

04:19.070 --> 04:21.420
developed by
the Verkle Development Corporation.

04:22.360 --> 04:24.010
Prepare to fire!

04:26.080 --> 04:27.660
Prepare to fire!

04:34.140 --> 04:36.260
Fire!

04:52.560 --> 04:54.950
The aim really isn't good enough...

04:54.950 --> 04:56.470
We can't fire continuously.

04:56.470 --> 04:58.560
The enemy will arrive
before the next volley.

04:59.830 --> 05:01.200
In that case...

05:01.200 --> 05:03.070
Commander in Chief Xylo,
it's your turn!

05:03.070 --> 05:04.880
Take down the enemy general.

05:05.410 --> 05:06.330
It can't be helped...

05:07.160 --> 05:09.000
I'll take care of the humans.

05:09.000 --> 05:10.290
Is that all right, Teoritta?

05:13.530 --> 05:14.710
Xylo.

05:15.410 --> 05:18.210
Are you really going to fight like this?

05:19.990 --> 05:21.260
What do you mean?

05:23.290 --> 05:27.450
You are always risking your life,

05:27.450 --> 05:30.010
but you always tell me not to.

05:34.230 --> 05:35.830
It doesn't matter to me.

05:35.830 --> 05:37.770
If I die, I'll be revived anyway.

05:37.770 --> 05:39.110
No.

05:39.560 --> 05:42.200
Even without that,
you would still fight, right?

05:43.170 --> 05:44.450
What are you trying to say?

05:45.240 --> 05:48.270
For the Holy Knights
and the miners at the fortress,

05:48.740 --> 05:52.540
even for those complete strangers
who are not here right now,

05:53.000 --> 05:55.010
you are always fighting for others.

05:56.020 --> 05:59.710
In the end, you are no different
from a goddess.

06:00.340 --> 06:04.790
But the reason you oppose
the very way the goddesses exist

06:05.910 --> 06:07.840
is that you reject your own kind!

06:15.400 --> 06:16.270
Ah...

06:16.850 --> 06:17.610
Damn it...

06:22.090 --> 06:23.650
Anyway, let's go.

06:24.280 --> 06:26.270
The Demon Lord is finally here.

06:27.110 --> 06:28.040
That's right.

06:28.040 --> 06:30.660
You are a hero,
and I am a goddess.

06:30.660 --> 06:33.620
I must bestow my blessing
upon your battle.

06:33.620 --> 06:36.380
This is our respective duty.

06:36.950 --> 06:38.590
So it cannot be helped, right?

06:39.570 --> 06:42.050
Yes, you're absolutely right.

06:43.670 --> 06:44.460
Xylo.

06:45.050 --> 06:47.570
We must win this battle!

06:48.090 --> 06:48.930
Right.

06:49.570 --> 06:50.430
Let's go!

06:57.400 --> 06:59.020
Why would humans...

06:59.020 --> 07:01.480
Is this where we're going to die?

07:07.950 --> 07:09.410
Hey...

07:15.070 --> 07:15.960
What's going on?

07:15.960 --> 07:17.040
Where did it come from?

07:17.460 --> 07:19.000
E-Enemy incoming!

07:36.400 --> 07:37.610
- What—
- Yikes!

07:39.570 --> 07:40.980
Q-Quickly, back him up!

07:41.520 --> 07:43.690
Everyone, fire!

07:55.080 --> 07:56.630
He... He vanished!

08:10.090 --> 08:11.740
What in the world is that thing?

08:13.930 --> 08:15.680
He's not human...

08:17.210 --> 08:18.230
That's...

08:20.230 --> 08:21.580
a Demon...

08:26.630 --> 08:27.570
Found it!

08:28.200 --> 08:29.300
It's Iblis!

08:33.620 --> 08:35.179
Minimize engagements!

08:35.179 --> 08:36.280
Go around.

08:36.280 --> 08:37.409
Understood!

08:37.789 --> 08:38.870
Take this.

08:38.870 --> 08:40.039
My knight!

08:40.970 --> 08:41.799
Alright!

08:43.250 --> 08:45.380
It's just as I imagined!

08:47.840 --> 08:48.970
Go!

09:01.370 --> 09:02.230
Xylo!

09:04.440 --> 09:05.610
Take that!

09:13.740 --> 09:15.240
Kyrack, huh?

09:16.790 --> 09:17.700
Take this!

09:23.000 --> 09:24.590
Teoritta, let's fly!

09:24.590 --> 09:25.170
Yes!

09:26.550 --> 09:27.710
What?

09:29.010 --> 09:30.840
It's a boggart?!

09:34.020 --> 09:36.710
Xylo, I will rain down swords upon them.

09:36.710 --> 09:37.600
No!

09:38.280 --> 09:40.850
Save your strength for Iblis!

09:41.400 --> 09:43.000
Even if you say that...

09:50.240 --> 09:52.070
Goddamn it...

10:07.470 --> 10:09.070
Teoritta, let's retreat!

10:12.200 --> 10:13.490
Xylo, that's...

10:13.990 --> 10:14.700
Tch.

10:23.500 --> 10:25.690
Venetim, why are those guys here?

10:25.690 --> 10:27.570
Didn't I refuse their aid?

10:28.650 --> 10:31.480
Ah... Xylo, are you angry?

10:32.150 --> 10:35.070
What the hell, you actually lied to me...

10:35.070 --> 10:37.410
Then let me ask you this:

10:38.010 --> 10:41.470
why would you think
I was telling the truth?

10:42.410 --> 10:43.300
Ugh...

10:43.300 --> 10:45.980
Xylo, help! This is bad!

10:45.980 --> 10:48.670
I'm screwed! I'm going to be killed!

10:48.670 --> 10:50.630
Dotta, what the hell are you doing?

10:50.630 --> 10:52.630
- I'm being chased by mercenaries!
- I'll kill you!

10:52.630 --> 10:53.550
- I'm being chased by mercenaries!
- Die!

10:53.550 --> 10:55.090
What? Why?

10:55.090 --> 10:56.890
I told you to hire them!

10:57.220 --> 10:59.760
I'd have to steal the money
to hire them anyway, right?

10:59.760 --> 11:03.350
Wouldn't it be faster and easier
to just steal from the mercenaries?

11:03.350 --> 11:04.950
Enough! Shut up!

11:05.440 --> 11:07.270
Give me back my money, you brat!

11:07.270 --> 11:09.360
Disrupt the faeries' formation.

11:13.380 --> 11:15.200
The Demon Lord is also at a loss.

11:15.200 --> 11:17.530
Looks like it's not as smart as I thought.

11:17.950 --> 11:19.740
Let's fly, Teoritta!

11:24.250 --> 11:25.960
Now! Can you do it?

11:25.960 --> 11:27.710
Of course!

11:44.060 --> 11:47.440
This is a sword
that values only size and strength.

11:47.440 --> 11:49.020
It will not last long.

11:49.020 --> 11:51.010
I understand. This is enough.

11:53.150 --> 11:56.140
My blessing is splendid, isn't it?

12:02.310 --> 12:03.250
Xylo?

12:06.830 --> 12:07.910
Let's go win this.

12:11.050 --> 12:11.900
Very well!

12:27.600 --> 12:29.020
Alright...

12:31.330 --> 12:32.770
That's right! Come at me!

12:50.540 --> 12:52.520
Xylo, this is...

12:52.520 --> 12:55.250
It's the trap we set during recon.

12:55.570 --> 12:57.020
It's the weathering seal.

12:57.970 --> 12:58.900
Teoritta!

12:58.900 --> 12:59.800
Yes!

13:01.720 --> 13:04.220
With this, it all ends.

13:12.270 --> 13:15.320
This time, the swords
will not vanish immediately.

13:42.010 --> 13:44.930
I'll have Kivia and the others
bring the Goddess's poison.

13:45.400 --> 13:47.150
You stay here and rest for a bit.

13:48.450 --> 13:51.990
There's no need to sacrifice the fortress.

13:53.930 --> 13:55.760
Looks like you've calmed down.

13:56.290 --> 13:57.440
Are you just going to...

14:04.400 --> 14:07.200
Teoritta, get away from there!

14:14.870 --> 14:17.170
My... My knight!

14:26.720 --> 14:29.030
Te-Teoritta!

14:32.600 --> 14:33.690
Run...

14:43.490 --> 14:44.990
Can't you hold on any longer...?

14:45.490 --> 14:47.190
- Everyone! Retreat quickly!
- Run!

14:47.190 --> 14:48.370
- Everyone! Retreat quickly!
- It's over here!

14:48.370 --> 14:50.040
We can't have any more casualties!

14:50.410 --> 14:52.870
Tsav, hold the retreat route!

14:52.870 --> 14:55.120
No, I'm in trouble too!

14:55.120 --> 14:56.080
Ah...

14:56.080 --> 14:58.060
- It's over! Run!
- Hey!

14:58.610 --> 14:59.840
Can I escape too?

15:01.260 --> 15:04.050
Everyone, please don't come here!

15:04.390 --> 15:06.260
Stay where you are!

15:06.260 --> 15:08.890
Wait! Somebody help me!

15:08.890 --> 15:11.390
The mercenaries are going to kill me!

15:18.440 --> 15:19.930
Xylo, your wounds...

15:20.360 --> 15:22.440
Teoritta, get out of here...

15:22.440 --> 15:23.610
But I'm...

15:23.610 --> 15:26.090
Those faeries won't come to us now.

15:29.200 --> 15:31.290
You're already at your limit...

15:31.830 --> 15:33.160
I can tell.

15:37.770 --> 15:41.630
Actually... you're right.

15:46.570 --> 15:49.000
I can't accept my own kind...

15:50.610 --> 15:51.850
I...

15:53.350 --> 15:55.730
want to win meaningful battles.

15:56.350 --> 15:59.190
I want to think I'm something special.

15:59.980 --> 16:03.150
I want to believe I'm still worthy...

16:04.530 --> 16:07.070
It's such a stupid, pointless motive.

16:08.280 --> 16:08.910
But

16:10.820 --> 16:14.220
this is... my battle.

16:18.010 --> 16:19.000
My knight.

16:20.000 --> 16:22.190
No matter what you think,

16:22.190 --> 16:24.830
I will fight by your side.

16:27.890 --> 16:28.800
Because...

16:29.400 --> 16:32.630
I am the great Goddess Teoritta.

16:34.790 --> 16:37.310
Yes, that's right.

16:37.310 --> 16:40.310
Xylo, if you do not wish for me to die,

16:40.310 --> 16:42.520
all you have to do is protect me.

16:42.990 --> 16:45.760
You are a great knight.

16:47.110 --> 16:48.400
I understand.

16:49.110 --> 16:51.340
Lend me your power, Teoritta.

16:52.330 --> 16:55.190
I'll decide where you put
your life on the line.

16:55.190 --> 16:55.990
Very well.

16:57.000 --> 16:59.620
I'll tell you when to die.

16:59.620 --> 17:01.000
Of course!

17:01.400 --> 17:02.250
That's why...

17:02.250 --> 17:03.710
we must win!

17:09.839 --> 17:12.329
I will prepare a special sword.

17:13.640 --> 17:16.010
This time, it is a truly special sword...

17:19.020 --> 17:20.480
Will it be able to kill it?

17:21.030 --> 17:22.440
Kill that immortal?

17:22.810 --> 17:25.290
Yes. This is the Holy Sword.

17:25.290 --> 17:27.589
There is nothing it cannot destroy.

17:28.740 --> 17:31.280
I will summon it from beyond this world.

17:31.870 --> 17:34.870
You only have one breath.
I will definitely hold on.

17:35.910 --> 17:38.160
So you want me to hit it
in one blow, right?

17:39.790 --> 17:41.040
Leave it to me!

17:43.000 --> 17:43.920
Very well.

17:43.920 --> 17:47.660
We will not falter, yield, or submit!

18:13.540 --> 18:14.450
Xylo!

18:21.540 --> 18:22.910
Xylo!

18:22.910 --> 18:25.790
I lost the mercenaries!
What are you doing?

18:25.790 --> 18:26.960
Let's get out of here!

18:32.300 --> 18:33.680
Ah...

18:34.220 --> 18:38.180
I wondered why you suddenly went silent.
So that's where you were.

18:38.180 --> 18:41.180
This is the final shot.

18:48.120 --> 18:49.020
Teoritta!

18:49.020 --> 18:50.570
Now!

19:08.260 --> 19:12.060
Just die already!

19:17.930 --> 19:24.020
Nothing is indestructible
before the Holy Sword.

20:06.100 --> 20:06.980
See?

20:08.190 --> 20:11.000
I am great... right?

20:16.210 --> 20:17.070
Yeah...

20:18.200 --> 20:20.350
You're amazing...

20:25.220 --> 20:26.710
Xylo!

20:27.330 --> 20:29.670
Teoritta is there too, right?

20:29.670 --> 20:32.340
- If you're hurt, go back!
- You're too slow...

20:32.340 --> 20:34.320
Huh? Wait, Xylo!

20:41.850 --> 20:43.000
Where am I...?

20:43.530 --> 20:46.640
Hey, looks like you're awake.

20:47.140 --> 20:50.000
How are you feeling, Xylo?

20:53.230 --> 20:54.260
Who are you?

20:54.730 --> 20:56.550
Don't worry.

20:56.550 --> 20:59.190
Thankfully, you're not dead.

20:59.720 --> 21:02.450
You were just one step away.

21:02.450 --> 21:05.600
I've repaired your body,

21:05.600 --> 21:08.000
so you don't need to go
to the repair shop.

21:08.420 --> 21:12.540
But you might have some memory
confusion as an aftereffect.

21:13.190 --> 21:14.380
Who are you...?

21:14.920 --> 21:19.130
You can think of me
as one of your companions.

21:19.130 --> 21:23.030
Anyway, I'm relieved you're safe.

21:23.030 --> 21:27.500
After all,
the hero unit is our trump card.

21:28.870 --> 21:30.060
Get lost.

21:30.060 --> 21:31.940
That's cold.

21:31.940 --> 21:34.230
I went through a lot of trouble

21:34.230 --> 21:36.780
to come and see you secretly
like this, you know.

21:36.780 --> 21:40.290
It wasn't easy to deliver the gift.

21:44.590 --> 21:47.870
It seems to be a token of gratitude
from a nearby settlement.

21:48.370 --> 21:50.880
And it seems you've gained
popularity among the people

21:50.880 --> 21:53.000
as the "Soaring Lightning."

21:53.000 --> 21:54.010
Get out.

21:56.920 --> 21:58.130
I understand.

21:58.500 --> 22:00.590
I'll do as you wish.

22:01.510 --> 22:03.470
But I still want you to know this.

22:04.110 --> 22:06.140
It's not just civilians.

22:06.140 --> 22:09.350
People in the Temple and the military
are also keeping an eye

22:09.350 --> 22:10.980
on you heroes and your activities.

22:10.980 --> 22:12.440
Get out!

22:20.640 --> 22:23.660
Oh, and one last thing.

22:24.090 --> 22:27.080
Be careful not to disobey orders too much.

22:27.590 --> 22:32.070
There's a group that truly
finds you all to be an eyesore.

22:32.070 --> 22:35.750
You, in particular, are being
closely watched by a certain force.

22:36.200 --> 22:37.310
I thought so.

22:38.350 --> 22:40.960
They are called the coexisters.

22:41.320 --> 22:44.550
They are a group that advocates
integrating with the Demon Blight.

22:45.570 --> 22:47.330
Now, if you'll excuse me.

22:53.230 --> 22:54.480
It's over now.

22:54.480 --> 22:56.980
You can go in, Goddess.

22:57.780 --> 22:58.710
Xylo.

23:15.870 --> 23:17.540
My knight?

23:17.540 --> 23:21.000
What is with that look on your face?

23:22.670 --> 23:27.890
I, the great goddess,
have come to visit you myself.

23:33.240 --> 23:34.770
I am going to get angry.

23:35.600 --> 23:36.520
Xylo.

23:37.540 --> 23:39.980
If you do not wish
to sing my praises...

23:40.960 --> 23:43.030
or rub my head...

23:43.750 --> 23:45.130
that is fine....

23:46.820 --> 23:47.510
But...

23:48.200 --> 23:49.240
But if...

23:51.020 --> 23:53.120
If you forget about me...

23:54.680 --> 23:56.460
I will never forgive you.

24:04.460 --> 24:05.630
I haven't forgotten.

24:06.130 --> 24:07.200
Teoritta.

24:09.010 --> 24:09.970
So,

24:10.760 --> 24:11.700
don't cry.

24:16.420 --> 24:18.020
I am not crying...

24:19.400 --> 24:20.400
Is that so?

24:21.030 --> 24:22.980
Because I am great.

24:25.150 --> 24:26.360
Yeah...
